invariant: INV-16
file: src/poly1305_wide.h
catches: diff_poly1305_wide
reason: the sum's form in C drops the carry out of h0 into h1, so a block whose
  low half and h0 pass 2^64 loses 2^64 of its value. bin/diff_poly1305_wide
  compiles that form under every compiler and compares the limbs with the
  Lean model's block, whose rows of all ones bits make the carry every
  time.

--- old
    *h1 = poly1305_wide_add(sum, carry, &carry);
--- new
    *h1 = poly1305_wide_add(sum, 0, &carry);
